{"id":2102,"level":79,"name":"Ловля фігури (2)","group":"Практика","format":27,"description":"<p><span style='font-weight: 400;'>If a piece has little freedom of movement, it can get into trouble. A simple attack on this piece will then immediately lead to material gain.</span></p>  <p></p>  <p><span style='font-weight: 400;'>Now that you are progressing further in the Chessity learning path, the tactical motives will become deeper. Before you can win material, you will sometimes have to make a few preparatory moves to chase an enemy piece.</span></p>  <p></p>  <p><b>What do you have to do?</b></p>  <p><span style='font-weight: 400;'>Win material by trapping a piece. Sometimes a few preparatory moves are needed.</span></p>","assignment":"","stickerID":0,"examples":[{"fen":"2rr2k1/Bpq2pbp/3pn1p1/3Qp3/2P5/1P6/P4PPP/1B1RR1K1 b - - 0 22","pgn":"22... b6 23. Bxb6 Qxb6 * ","text":"<p>Білі дуже прагнули взяти пішака на a7. Після<strong> 1...b6! </strong>Білі, безсумнівно, шкодує про це.</p>","format":27},{"fen":"5rk1/5ppp/5r2/p1p1pN1b/Pp1bPq1P/1P1Q1P2/2PN2P1/1R2R2K w - - 0 32","pgn":"32. g3 Rxf5 33. gxf4 * ","text":"<p>Чорний ферзь здається небезпечною. Але після 1...g3! раптом з’ясовується, що у неї більше немає полів шахівниці втечі.</p>","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":77933,"fen":"r5r1/1p2kqbQ/p3bp2/3np3/P1BpN3/3P4/1PPB2P1/R4RK1 b - - 0 24","pgn":"{[%csl Rh7][%evp 0,3,-362,-255,-616,-613]} {Q=1} 24... Rh8 25. Qxh8 Rxh8 (25... Bxh8) * ","format":27,"texts":["Білий ферзь мало рухливий."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":77935,"fen":"2kr4/1pp2ppR/p4b2/2P5/2RP2P1/4K3/PP2N1r1/8 w - - 0 27","pgn":"{[%csl Rg2][%evp 0,3,110,120,113,122]} {Q=1} 27. Kf3 Rxe2 28. Kxe2 * ","format":27,"texts":["Чорна тура задихається."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":77946,"fen":"r4rk1/ppq2pb1/2p1b1p1/3np1Bp/4N2P/3BPP2/PPP1Q1P1/3R1RK1 b - - 0 20","pgn":"{[%csl Rg5][%evp 0,3,-167,-143,-227,-138]} {Q=1} 20... f6 21. Bxf6 Nxf6 (21... Bxf6) (21... Rxf6) * ","format":27,"text